
> jev-p0@0.1.0 cli
> node dist/src/cli/index.js --help

Jev local mock CLI

Commands:
  service start | health | stop [--runtime DIR]
  schemas [--json]
  demo [--runtime DIR] [--credential FILE] [--json]
  open_session | observe | run_goal | cancel | status | close_session
    --args '{"session_id":"..."}' [--credential FILE] [--json]

All tools share the coordinator safety gate. Only local synthetic fixtures and mock decisions are enabled.
service start --share-a-with-b enables an explicit a-to-b session ACL for local contention testing.
